Subject: [PATCH] Admin: Experimentation section for the feedback-group study

New nav section Experimentation -> Feedback group study
(/admin/experimentation, flag adminExperimentation): the 30-person,
8-week outcomes pilot. Overview (timeline, headline figures,
pre-registered success criteria - outcome lines "not yet" until week 8 -
WHO-5 by cohort, cohort table, limits), Participants (pseudonymous,
filterable, CSV), What we collect (every measure, schedule, source,
whether production collects it), Data & safety (follow-ups, completeness,
missing questionnaires), and a page per participant.

Rules and seeded sample data in admin/data/study.ts, with tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
